                Building at the intersection of <span class="typed-wrapper" id="typed"></span>
            </p>
        </section>

        <hr class="divider">

        <section class="section reveal" id="about">
            <p class="section-label">01 — About</p>
            <h2 class="section-title">Who I Am</h2>
            <p>
                I'm <strong>Rounak Ranjan</strong>, a biochemistry student at <strong>Central University of Rajasthan (CURAJ)</strong>.
                My work sits at the convergence of <span class="highlight">biology, data, and technology</span> — 
                with a driving focus on computational biology and bioinformatics.
            </p>
            <p>
                My academic foundation is strengthened by real, hands-on projects: contributing to research on 
                <strong>microbial arsenic biotransformation</strong> in an environmental science laboratory, 
                building <strong>Python-based data pipelines</strong> for biological data analysis, and helping 
                content creators secure <strong>genuine, well-matched brand collaborations</strong> through 
                strategic outreach and transparent negotiation.
            </p>
            <p>
                I operate on a simple principle: <strong>learn by doing</strong>. Whether I'm writing bioinformatics 
                scripts, analyzing peer-reviewed literature, or negotiating a creator's first brand partnership — 
                I prioritize <strong>real, verifiable experience</strong> over empty titles. Every project is a 
                deliberate step toward mastering the intersection of life sciences and computational thinking.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="section reveal" id="work">
            <p class="section-label">02 — Current Focus</p>
            <h2 class="section-title">What I'm Working On</h2>
            <div class="card-grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-icon">🔬</div>
                    <h3>Computational Biology & Bioinformatics</h3>
                    <p>Building strong foundations in Python, data analysis, and biological data processing — working toward expertise at the intersection of AI and the life sciences.</p>
                    <div class="card-tags">
                        <span class="tag">Python</span>
                        <span class="tag">Data Pipelines</span>
                        <span class="tag">Bioinformatics</span>
                        <span class="tag">AI / ML</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-icon">🧪</div>
                    <h3>Research Experience</h3>
                    <p>Actively contributing to laboratory research on microbial arsenic biotransformation — conducting literature analysis, structuring data pipelines, and supporting experimental workflows.</p>
                    <div class="card-tags">
                        <span class="tag">Environmental Science</span>
                        <span class="tag">Lab Research</span>
                        <span class="tag">Data Analysis</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-icon">📈</div>
                    <h3>Creator Partnerships</h3>
                    <p>Working closely with select content creators to secure well-matched brand deals — managing outreach, negotiation, and deliverables with complete transparency and focused attention.</p>
                    <div class="card-tags">
                        <span class="tag">Brand Outreach</span>
                        <span class="tag">Negotiation</span>
                        <span class="tag">Strategy</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section reveal" id="services">
            <p class="section-label">03 — Services</p>
            <h2 class="section-title">Creator Partnerships</h2>
            <p>
                I help content creators land genuine, well-aligned brand deals — handling the business side so they 
                can stay focused on creating. My approach is intentionally <strong>high-touch and selective</strong>: 
                I work with a <strong>small number of creators at a time</strong> to deliver real, focused attention 
                rather than spreading thin across dozens of accounts.
            </p>
            <div class="service-grid">
                <div class="service-item">
                    <span class="service-icon">🎯</span>
                    <strong>Brand Outreach</strong>
                    <span>Identifying and approaching brands that genuinely fit a creator's niche, audience demographics, and personal values.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="service-item">
                    <span class="service-icon">💰</span>
                    <strong>Fair Negotiation</strong>
                    <span>Securing compensation based on real engagement metrics and reach data — never relying on follower count alone.</span>
                </div>
